{"id":"b6d83d8b210d3464","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure.md","title":"ZFC Set10 Finite Sequence Closure","display":"df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure — ZFC Set10 Finite Sequence Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure — ZFC Set10 Finite Sequence Closure","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure — ZFC Set10 Finite Sequence Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"870a865cad3f0fc0\" href=\"?note=870a865cad3f0fc0\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,f\\in V\">\\(H,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"870a865cad3f0fc0\" href=\"?note=870a865cad3f0fc0\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S(f,H)\\to f\\in H\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S(f,H)\\to f\\in H\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cited finite-sequence predicate supplies functionhood as well as a finite ordinal domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"870a865cad3f0fc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"870a865cad3f0fc0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-zfc-seq-finite-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set10\\text{-}finite\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet10FiniteSequenceClosure}_S(H)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall f\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqFiniteSequence}_S(f,H)\\to f\\in H\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1010,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure.md|58-df-zfc-set10-finite-sequence-closure]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","870a865cad3f0fc0"]}